  "details": "1. Open Settings from Main Menu in desktop mode.\n\n2. Make sure \"Always Show VRChat Soft Keyboard\" is enabled in User Interface → General UI Settings.\n\n3. Search for \"soft\", and press the Enter key on your physical keyboard.\n\nExpected result: The VRChat Soft Keyboard closes on Enter key press/release, so that the settings can be seen.\n\nActual result: The search goes through, but the VRChat Soft Keyboard stays on top obscuring all settings. Clicking with a mouse cursor off the keyboard doesn't close the soft keyboard either in most cases, and the soft keyboard \"X\" button to close it is off-screen (in the default 1024x768 desktop mode window resolution).",
